I reached the top of the mountain.
There was a famous viewpoint there.
I stood there quietly.
I looked down at the deep valley.
The natural landscape of the valley was very beautiful.
There was a tourist near me.
That tourist gave me his mobile phone.
He said, "Please take my picture."
I took his picture with his mobile phone.
After that, I took out the camera from my own bag.
I took pictures of the natural landscape with my own camera.
That view was very captivating.
The wind on top of the mountain was cool.
The sun was slowly setting.
I completely lost track of time.
I spent almost two hours there.
My mind was very peaceful.
